{
  "version": "2.11",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "news001",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 80,
      "name": "11 Newsletter CTA - Prompt",
      "width": 1200,
      "fill": "$canvas-white",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 16,
      "padding": 32,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "news002",
          "name": "title",
          "fill": "$text-ink",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Newsletter CTA",
          "fontFamily": "$font-display",
          "fontSize": 48,
          "lineHeight": 1,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "news003",
          "name": "usage-context",
          "fill": "$text-ink",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Used near the bottom of the homepage, feed, post page, or footer to invite readers to subscribe or take a primary action.",
          "fontFamily": "$font-body",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "lineHeight": 1.4,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "news004",
          "name": "pencil-visual-prompt",
          "fill": "$text-ink",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Prompt: Using root DESIGN.MD as the primary design source and DESIGN.pen as the Pencil component library, create an editable newsletter-cta component. Reuse footer-newsletter, button-primary, and form input patterns from DESIGN.pen. Create dark near-black/deep-green variants plus mobile layout. Include coral label, white headline, supporting text, email field, submit affordance, and legal microcopy. Keep it premium, restrained, and not marketing-card heavy. Target code file: src/components/_newsletter_cta.hbs.",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "newscode",
          "name": "html-css-code-prompt",
          "fill": "$text-ink",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Code prompt: Convert this newsletter CTA design into src/components/_newsletter_cta.hbs. Use the current .pen file as the visual source of truth, root DESIGN.MD as the design authority, DESIGN.pen as the component library reference, and tailwind.config.js as the code token source. Generate production-ready Hamlet Builder Handlebars markup with Tailwind CSS classes. Return only the partial markup for src/components/_newsletter_cta.hbs. Do not generate React, JSX, CSS Modules, Vue, external CSS frameworks, or unrelated JavaScript. Use semantic HTML and accessible attributes. Preserve Blogger dynamic behavior where relevant with Blogger/Hamlet tags and realistic placeholders only where dynamic data is unavailable. After copying the output into the repo, npm run build must pass.",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
